  "description": "Introducing the UrbanGlide - Ultra Electric Assist Bicycle\nExplore the city in style with the UrbanGlide - Ultra Electric Assist Bicycle. Available in Gunmetal Blue/Lava Red, this sleek and dynamic bike offers a perfect blend of performance and aesthetics.\nKey Features:\nSize Options: Choose between S and L sizes for a personalized and comfortable riding experience.\nEffortless Pedal-Assist: Enjoy a smooth and effortless ride with the advanced Pedal-Assist system.\nBafang® M600 Mid Drive Motor 500W : The bike is equipped with a robust Bafang® M600 Mid Drive Motor 500W, providing powerful support for your rides.\nLong-Lasting Battery: With a 48V 15Ah, 690Wh battery, the UrbanGlide - Ultra ensures a durable and long-lasting power supply for your journeys.\nImpressive Speed: Reach a maximum speed of 20mph, ensuring a thrilling and efficient ride.\nBrake system：Hydraulic Disc Brake 180mm Rotors\nShock absorbing system：Zoom® Hydraulic Suspension Fork with Lockout, 80mm Travel\nspeed system:Microshift® RD-M26L 9-Speed\nExtended Range: Experience freedom with a range of 65-70 miles on a single charge, perfect for long-distance rides.\nSturdy Build: Weighing at 32kg, the bike offers a solid and stable foundation for your urban adventures.\nSafety Certified: Complies with UL 2849 and CPSC | 16-CFR-2015 standards, ensuring the utmost safety and reliability.\nElevate your commuting experience with the UrbanGlide -Ultra. Whether you're navigating city streets or exploring scenic routes, this electric assist bicycle combines style, performance, and safety for an unparalleled riding experience. The #1 Mountain Electric Bike. 100% Free Tax. 6-Year Warranty+30+ repair shops, 5/14 professional customer service support",
